title: Change order template for flooring jobs (free PDF) | Jobchit
description: A free, printable change-order form for flooring jobs. Area in square feet, material, tear-out, subfloor repair, trim, the price change and both signatures. No account needed.
heading: Change order for flooring
sub: For when the area grows, or the old floor comes up and the subfloor needs work. Fill it in and get both signatures before you go on.
tips:
  - Write the area change in square feet, with a plus or minus, and the product the customer picked.
  - If the subfloor is rotten or uneven once the old floor is up, take photos and write it up here before you fix it.
  - Say who moves the furniture and appliances, and who hauls away the old floor.
  - Both sides sign and date it before the extra work starts. Give the customer a copy.
  - Some states have their own rules for change orders. Check with your state licensing board.
---
